tegory_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"mBXxL7776PIpye9GRDLu6Q","review_id":"BzUCl5RkuTT8ageLr5TvAg","date":"2012-08-07T04:38:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9413813352584839,"text_excerpt":"Could not have been happier with selecting to make reservations with Apolline for Sunday brunch! It's small, gorgeous interior with tons of natural light. They were serving two dollar mimosas and three dollar bloody mary drink specials-- so you know, I think my table of four had eleven mimosas and a bloody mary. They're very generous with the pours too! We had the Pomme Frites as an appetizer-- and although they come out in an unnecessary setup in a vase of sorts, it can be ignored because they're so good! The chefs had to sub in some things from the menu, but it turned out better this way. Most of the table ordered The Crispy Confit Chicken with French Toast--which was instead Crispy Con..."},{"business_id":"mBXxL7776PIpye9GRDLu6Q","review_id":"SgysZG--xvvJczyfh5WMgw","date":"2016-10-14T14:44:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9402285814285278,"text_excerpt":"My wife and I won a silent auction dinner for two here and used it last night. Two custom crafted cocktails, appetizers, entrees and dessert. This is a really beautiful and comfortable restaurant. The service and ambiance is just terrific. I picked a cocktail off their menu and Miriam had one altered slightly for fun. Both were crafted by their experienced bartender. He's been a mixologist for 15 years and is very talented. Miriam started with the charbroiled oysters and I tried the brussels sprouts with duck confit. The oysters were some of the best I've ever had in NOLA. They had just the right amount of butter, cheese and char. They were delicate and juicy and perfectly balanced. My sp..."},{"business_id":"mBXxL7776PIpye9GRDLu6Q","review_id":"l6GcbjQvQ34Y4wcAGcXaGQ","date":"2014-06-01T23:21:30","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9372467398643494,"text_excerpt":"I've only ever had brunch here, twice, but both times I enjoyed it very much. Menu is small but the food is really good, and they have bottomless mimosas which is always a bonus! They also have an incredible Bloody Mary that has a bacon wrapped shrimp on top. The place is beautiful, very clean and bright, I will hopefully make it here for dinner soon!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"mBXxL7776PIpye9GRDLu6Q","photo_id":"0wlquSIuC2i3EssC3bTAtA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/0wlquSIuC2i3EssC3bTAtA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9001118540763855},{"business_id":"mBXxL7776PIpye9GRDLu6Q","photo_id":"qY3cEWcSnWZft-y6dlJVtw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/qY3cEWcSnWZft-y6dlJVtw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8798428773880005},{"business_id":"mBXxL7776PIpye9GRDLu6Q","photo_id":"rmUxCGV7zNC5Me-cf1YUkg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/rmUxCGV7zNC5Me-cf1YUkg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8570312261581421},{"business_id":"mBXxL7776PIpye9GRDLu6Q","photo_id":"G5ifPVcrsXJWQR50ZteDng","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/G5ifPVcrsXJWQR50ZteDng.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.808382511138916},{"business_id":"mBXxL7776PIpye9GRDLu6Q","photo_id":"Il4sHOddw4oXAeKmXwGufw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Il4sHOddw4oXAeKmXwGufw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.748327136039